      "writtenOn": "2017-05-02T22:21:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shouldn\u0027t we use a shorter delay in this case?\n\nSomething like:\n\n»       uint64_t delay \u003d BASE_DETECT_DEBOUNCE_US;\n»       uint64_t time_now \u003d get_time().val;\n\n»       if (base_detect_debounce_time \u003c\u003d time_now) {\n»       »       if (current_base_status \u003d\u003d BASE_CONNECTED \u0026\u0026\n»       »           gpio_get_level(signal)) {\n»       »       »       pulse_start \u003d time_now;\n»       »       »       pulse \u003d 0;\n»       »       »       delay \u003d 150;\n»       »       }\n»       »       hook_call_deferred(\u0026base_detect_deferred_data, delay);\n»       }\n\nIf we do that, we will have to update the logic in deferred handler to delay for BASE_DETECT_DEBOUNCE_US - 150 in case of disconnect.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 224,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 228,
        "endChar": 3
      },
      "revId": "5dac402da6db603a76cdc4d37ebbc1e1c44bb669",
