      "writtenOn": "2017-05-03T01:44:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s a good question. I think it\u0027s better to wait until the end of the debounce period, just in case there are other pulses (and the first pulse we got was actually noise). Also, I don\u0027t think delaying the wake by another 5ms is a big issue.",
      "parentUuid": "768db65a_356bb570",
      "range": {
